      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/anadoluagency/status/2007102675259711673",
      "text": "🚨 Swiss authorities give latest update on deadly Crans-Montana bar fire\n\n▪️ Swiss prosecutors say everything suggests the fire started from sparkling candles placed on champagne bottles that were moved too close to the ceiling\n\n▪️ Swiss police say 40 people have died, with identification still ongoing under internationally standardized procedures\n\n▪️ 119 people injured, many in critical condition; 113 identified, 6 remain to be identified\n\n▪️ Among the injured are 71 Swiss, 14 French, 11 Italian, 4 Serbian, 1 Bosnian, as well as Belgian, Polish and Portuguese nationals; 14 injured nationalities remain unknown\n\n▪️ Police say identification files have been opened with several countries, including Switzerland, Belgium, France, Italy, Portugal, Türkiye, the Philippines, the Congo, Romania and the Czech Republic\n\n▪️According to Italian Foreign Minister Antonio Tajani, at least 47 people killed and about 112 injured, most of them severely",
